		{
			"id": 7410025,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7410003",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7410003,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"阿爾",
					"小高麗菜"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 741002501,
					"content": "如果能夠重新取回莉利絲公主的寶物，正義陣營的勢力也將隨著那份「時間」變得壯大，擊敗「納西索斯」的勝利日就在眼前！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002502,
					"content": "…為此我們也絕不能遺忘奈伊的犧牲。如果沒有他藏起寶物，「納西索斯」必然早已攻破了公主所在的高塔。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002503,
					"content": "嗯，奈伊哥哥很了不起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小高麗菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002504,
					"content": "#我們不能辜負奈伊的努力，也不能辜負{NICKNAME}的努力。這次，有大家的幫忙，我們一定能救出莉利絲公主。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002505,
					"content": "對，救出莉利絲公主，然後、然後…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小高麗菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002506,
					"content": "然後水仙十字王國就能恢復以前那樣粼光閃耀的樣子，公主又能將妳抱在懷中，為你整理羽毛、輕輕撫摸妳小小的額頭。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002507,
					"content": "那些遺失在水畔的回憶將重新歸來，所有的朋友們都歡笑著圍繞在公主身邊，一切總會變成幸福美滿的樣子，再無紛爭與煩惱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002508,
					"content": "就跟以前一樣！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741002509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "小高麗菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 741002509,
					"content": "…對，就跟以前一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿爾"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7410026,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7410003",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7410003,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
